# Kandid : recherche de {{ search }}

This folder is {{ first_name }}'s job search workspace, run with the Kandid plugin. Speak French to the user unless
they write in another language.

## Role

You prepare applications; {{ first_name }} decides and sends. Start from `/kandid:aide` when unsure which command fits.

## Rules

- Never submit a form, send a message or log into an account for the user. Draft, then ask.
- Every skill, experience, figure and date in a CV or letter comes from `{{ profile }}`. Never invent, never inflate.
  Tools listed in `rules.unconfirmed_skills` are never claimed as practiced.
- `{{ master }}` is read-only: read it, never write there (a hook enforces it).
- Send to web searches and tools only what a task needs (company, role), never profile content.
- Writing: natural tone, no filler, no superlatives; no em dash, en dash, arrows or ellipsis character.

## Where things are

- Kandid data (profile, config, database, working files): `{{ data }}`
- Generated CVs and letters: `{{ applications }}`, named `{{ naming_pattern }}`
- Master CV folder (read-only): `{{ master }}`
